cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use GrowFast in your work, please cite it as below."
title: "GrowFast"
type: software
abstract: "GrowFast is a B2B lead-finding and cold-outreach service built for AI agents to operate over MCP and REST: the agent scans a product's domain, finds matching companies with an MX-checked contact address, drafts the emails and, when told to, sends them with follow-ups; the human owner approves and audits."
url: "https://growfast.sh"
repository-code: "https://github.com/airdropfi/growfast-gemini-extension"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - mcp
  - mcp-server
  - b2b-leads
  - cold-email
  - ai-agents
authors:
